  ('Your family watching every plate?','Mistake: Turning every meal into a fight','N_CAKE','Saying no at every birthday. Checking before every meal. Everyone watching what you put on your plate. It wears you down, and it still doesn’t touch what’s happening in your cells.','Add daily support instead of another rule. Two capsules with breakfast, and eat with your family.†','C_POUR'),
